Z||000000||NEFA||06-25-2001||11:35 AM||||NEFA is having its 2nd annual Swap meet at Kick Hill Farm in Lebanon CT.<P><BR>8:00 start time to "whenever". Possible get togethers on Friday evening and/or Sunday. Bring whatever you want to sell or trade. Anything Fiero related... Parts, Literature, Toys, Memorabilia... even whole cars! A great place to help yourself and others. More details coming soon.<P>ALSO<P>June 30,July 1-2 NE Summer Nationals (Hot Rod) Worcester, MA <A HREF="http://www.summernationals.com/index2.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.summernationals.com/index2.html</A> <BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fieropride.com/logos/NEFA_Logo12_small.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com/calendar.htm" TARGET=_blank>Upcoming Club Events</A> <P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/jaygee79/tshirt.html" TARGET=_blank>Get your Club T-shirt</A>||||reg||7
