Z||000006||NEFA||07-07-2001||10:17 AM||||Hi ALL!!!<P>This is to remind everyone about NEFA's Second Annual Swap Meet at Kick Hill Farms July 14Th.  The festivities will begin at 8:00 till whenever.  Bring anything Fiero related to sell/swap/whatever.  If you don't have anthing to sell then bring a friend!  This event is held at Kick Hill Farms in Lebanon Ct.  Bound to be a good time!  If you have any questions you can visit our website at <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieropride.com</A>  and click on calender or email me at chester@ttlc.net or Eric Schneck at eschneck@bigfoot.com <P>Thanks and hope to see YOU there!<P>Rob D<BR>NEFA Events Director and Fiero Junkie  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||7
